      "value": "I feel that if a world creator does something like that intentionally make people look worse, people will tend to not stay on the world. So I think this is a non-issue, abuse on worlds like that are not as significant to remove world creators from another feature. We already have many other features that we want and can't. And that could still be used by the same creators to optmize their worlds, there's some textures that I don't importance and give a -1, but now I can't, because I got removed from changing that number.",
